Improper Input Validation and Authentication Flaws The application may not adequately validate user inputs, leading to potential injection attacks or improper authentication., Insecure Password Storage and Token Management If passwords are not securely hashed or tokens are not properly managed, it can lead to unauthorized access and data breaches.

